    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Create a flowchart to implement **one** of the following rules:\r\n\r\n   a. An order qualifies for free shipping only if the total is over $50 **AND** the customer has a coupon.\r\n\r\n   b. An order qualifies for free shipping if the total is over $50 **OR** the customer has a coupon.  \r\n\r\n2. Save your flowchart to your **Backpack**.\r\n",
